: 11.4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11.4pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\">- 산업대학원 : 6학기 이상 등록하고 지도교수의 추천을 받은 자&nbsp; </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11.4pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11.4pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\">- 교육대학원</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11.4pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\"> : 5학기 이상 등록하고 지도교수의 추천을 받은 자&nbsp; </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13.3pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13.3pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">3. 시험과목 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11.4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp; <!--StartFragment--><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11.4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">가. 석사 과정 : 주임교수가 지정하는 </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11.4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">3과목</span>\n</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11.4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 박사 과정 : 주임교수가 지정하는</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11.4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"> 4과목</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11.4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;다. 응시 과목 : </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">동일교수의 과목만으로 시행할 수 없으며, 석․박사과정 모두 문제출제<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;교수가 반드시 2명 이상이어야 함.</span></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11.4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<font size=\"3\"> ※ 졸업종합시험 응시과목은 학차에 따라 한 과목씩 따로&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;응시할 수 없으며, </font></span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><font size=\"3\">석사 3과목 이상․박사 4과목 이상<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;해당과목을&nbsp;일괄적으로 응시하여야 함 </font></span><span style=\"COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><font size=\"3\">(단, 응시과목 중<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;불합격한 과목에 대해서는 한 과목 응시 가능함)</font></span></p>\n</span>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 155%\"><span style=\"COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13.3pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">4. 시험시간</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11.4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; 가.</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11.4pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"> 석사과정 : 19:00 ~ 21:30</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11.4pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; 나. 박사과정 : 19:00 ~ 22:20</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11.4pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13.3pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">5. 시험 장소</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11.4pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; - 추후 공지</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11.4pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11.4pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">2010. 09.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">금오공과대학교 대학원(일반, 산업 및 교육대학원)장</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
